{"results":[{"id":"65fc927506c4feecdf1d0391","name":"Security Brief: TA450 Uses Embedded Links in PDF Attachments in Latest Campaign","description":"Proofpoint researchers recently observed new activity by the Iran-aligned threat actor TA450, known for targeting Israeli entities, in which the group used a pay-related social engineering lure to target Israeli employees at large multinational organizations. In the phishing campaign, TA450 sent emails with PDF attachments containing malicious links 
leading to the download of remote administration software known to be abused by TA450. This activity continues TA450's trend of leveraging Hebrew language lures and compromised Israeli accounts to target individuals at companies with an Israeli footprint.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2024-03-21T20:10:54.124000","created":"2024-03-21T20:03:01.557000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"TA450","indicators":[{"id":3860439844,"indicator":"cc4cc20b558096855c5d492f7a79b160a809355798be2b824525c98964450492","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2024-03-21T20:03:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3860439845,"indicator":"dee6494e69c6e7289cf3f332e2867662958fa82f819615597e88c16c967a25a9","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2024-03-21T20:03:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3860439846,"indicator":"e89f48a7351c01cbf2f8e31c65a67f76a5ead689bb11e9d4918090a165d4425f","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2024-03-21T20:03:02","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null}],"tags":["phishing","remote access trojan","ateraagent","iran"],"targeted_countries":["Israel"],"malware_families":[],"attack_ids":["T1204.002","T1566.001","T1598.002","T1059.001","T1566"],"references":["https:\/\/www.proofpoint.com\/us\/blog\/threat-insight\/security-brief-ta450-uses-embedded-links-pdf-attachments-latest-campaign"],"industries":["Manufacturing","Technology"],"extract_source":[],"more_indicators":false},{"id":"65fc916967e188b26fe41f0b","name":"AcidPour | New Embedded Wiper Variant of AcidRain Appears in Ukraine","description":"SentinelLabs discovered a new Linux wiper named AcidPour, a variant of AcidRain used in attacks against Ukraine. AcidPour expands on AcidRain's capabilities to better target Linux devices like networking gear, IoT, RAIDs, and possibly ICS. Its discovery coincides with telecoms disruptions in Ukraine claimed by a GRU hacktivist persona. Technical analysis confirms similarities between AcidPour and AcidRain, linking it to clusters attributed to Russian intelligence.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2024-03-21T20:02:15.226000","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:33.601000","revision":3,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"Sandworm","indicators":[{"id":3859264975,"indicator":"1bde1e4ecc8a85cffef1cd4e5379aa44","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3859264976,"indicator":"b5de486086eb2579097c141199d13b0838e7b631","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3859264977,"indicator":"6a8824048417abe156a16455b8e29170f8347312894fde2aabe644c4995d7728","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":2195427359,"indicator":"185.61.137.155","type":"IPv4","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":"2024-04-20T19:00:00","is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3860438744,"indicator":"solntsepek.com","type":"domain","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3536832006,"indicator":"solntsepek.info","type":"domain","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3860438745,"indicator":"solntsepek.org","type":"domain","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3860438746,"indicator":"solntsepek.ru","type":"domain","created":"2024-03-21T19:58:34","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null}],"tags":["acidpour","wiper","acidrain","ukraine","cve-2022-22965"],"targeted_countries":["Ukraine"],"malware_families":["AcidRain","AcidPour"],"attack_ids":["T1489","T1036","T1059","T1070","T1531","T1486","T1496","T1529"],"references":["https:\/\/www.sentinelone.com\/labs\/acidpour-new-embedded-wiper-variant-of-acidrain-appears-in-ukraine\/"],"industries":["Telecommunications"],"extract_source":[],"more_indicators":false},{"id":"65fc90429e7f43fbbef20918","name":"New details on TinyTurla\u2019s post-compromise activity reveal full kill chain","description":"Cisco Talos provides an update on its reports on a campaign where Turla, a Russian espionage group, deployed their TinyTurla-NG implant. The analysis reveals Turla infected systems in a European NGO's network, compromised the first system, established persistence, and added exclusions to AV products. Turla then opened channels via Chisel for exfiltration and pivoting. The full kill chain is traced from compromise to exfiltration.","author_name":"AlienVault","modified":"2024-03-21T19:57:01.471000","created":"2024-03-21T19:53:38.257000","revision":2,"tlp":"white","public":1,"adversary":"Turla","indicators":[{"id":3840889682,"indicator":"e4c356cf822cda0ca8e8161cb5bf6c39","type":"FileHash-MD5","created":"2024-03-21T19:53:39","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3840889683,"indicator":"ee350f5295fc127285791b76f2a2be98d7681a91","type":"FileHash-SHA1","created":"2024-03-21T19:53:39","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3840488851,"indicator":"267071df79927abd1e57f57106924dd8a68e1c4ed74e7b69403cdcdf6e6a453b","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2024-03-21T19:53:39","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id":3844653994,"indicator":"ad4d196b3d85d982343f32d52bffc6ebfeec7bf30553fa441fd7c3ae495075fc","type":"FileHash-SHA256","created":"2024-03-21T19:53:39","content":"","title":"","description":"","expiration":null,"is_active":1,"role":null},{"id"